#: scenario6:scenario6_DB08BB38_A638_4FA0_A996_6B4CFF26E22A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4457de13faf0c38f472cb826d789571d3e3008ba380ab19933f765f5a1fba2e9
