#: scenario6:scenario6_1AB25D46_6BEB_4E6E_973E_C8B225EC1510
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c2da1599b3e429909c3f75f582c16b6f157b34d346eff3215f572d68675baf6
